        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "Layer A: live byte-range streaming \u00b7 Layer B: volatile RAM replay \u00b7 Layer C: away prefix\nNo durable storage \u2014 the TTL sweeper drops the share, cache, and prefix at expiry."
